{"id":"608dba5bf464e33e","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-rule-modus.md","title":"GL Rule Modus Ponens","display":"df-gl-rule-modus — GL Rule Modus Ponens","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-rule-modus","aliases":["89-df-gl-rule-modus"],"display":"df-gl-rule-modus — GL Rule Modus Ponens","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-rule]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-rule-modus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-rule-modus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-rule-modus — GL Rule Modus Ponens"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0218073c8db43619\" href=\"?note=0218073c8db43619\" title=\"89-df-gl-rule\">89-df-gl-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the\nrule relation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0218073c8db43619\" href=\"?note=0218073c8db43619\" title=\"89-df-gl-rule\">89-df-gl-rule</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}rule\\text{-}modus}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}^{\\star}\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}rule\\text{-}modus}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}^{\\star}\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>模态命题规则是 GL 的基本规则</li>\n<li>模态命题规则保持 GL 的有效性</li>\n<li>MP 是本书采用的 Hilbert 系统及所有正常模态逻辑的闭包规则；“任意\n被称为模态逻辑的集合”并不由名称自动具有该规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-rule","status":"resolved","id":"0218073c8db43619","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-rule","status":"resolved","id":"0218073c8db43619","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the\nrule relation from [[89-df-gl-rule]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}rule\\text{-}modus}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}^{\\star}\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}.","display":true}],"bytes":844,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-rule-modus]]"}],"outgoing":["0218073c8db43619"]}